{% comment %}
   | Purpose              | Color             | Hex       |
  | -------------------- | ----------------- | --------- |
  | Primary brand        | Deep Royal Purple | `#32166F` |
  | Primary dark         | Midnight Plum     | `#21103F` |
  | Pink accent          | Vibrant Magenta   | `#D91472` |
  | Yellow accent        | Warm Saffron      | `#F4B51B` |
  | Main background      | Warm Ivory        | `#FCF9F4` |
  | Secondary background | Soft Blush        | `#F8EDF2` |
  | Text                 | Deep Charcoal     | `#18151C` |
  | Secondary text       | Muted Plum Grey   | `#675E6D` |
  | Border               | Warm Grey         | `#E7E0E5` |
  | White                | Pure White        | `#FFFFFF` |
{% endcomment %}

{% style %}
  :root {
    --brand-primary: #32166f;
    --brand-primary-dark: #21103f;
    --brand-accent-pink: #d91472;
    --brand-accent-yellow: #f4b51b;
    --brand-background: #fcf9f4;
    --brand-background-secondary: #f8edf2;
    --brand-text: #18151c;
    --brand-text-secondary: #675e6d;
    --brand-border: #e7e0e5;
    --brand-white: #ffffff;
  }
{% endstyle %}
